{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21650","headline":"赠吴渠州从姨兄士则 · 元稹","name":"赠吴渠州从姨兄士则","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔分襟童子郎，白头抛掷又他乡。\n三千里外巴南恨，二十年前城里狂。\n甯氏舅甥俱寂寞，荀家兄弟半沦亡。\n泪因生别兼怀旧，廻首江山欲万行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}